      "summary_zh": "其中的自改进实验根据运行反馈改写共享 Python 操作与指南并跨任务组复用；未显示明显优于默认配置，且每回合成本更高。最终静态方案的提升与此分开；实验接触被评分任务，各轮任务组不同，每配置仅评测一次。",
      "summary_en": "A self-improvement experiment revises shared Python operations and a guide from execution feedback and reuses them across task groups. It does not clearly outperform the default and costs more per episode. Gains of the final static system are separate; the improvement runs encounter scored tasks, use different groups across rounds, and evaluate each configuration once.",
